{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serene Ponds is a calm, creative sandbox about creating a peaceful pond for wildlife. Shape the land, add decorations and plants, and watch frogs gradually make themselves at home. There\u2019s no rush or failure, just the freedom to create and care for your pond at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/624f87854c9411a58623e4dbdeea8d08.poster.avif?t=1769168402\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/624f87854c9411a58623e4dbdeea8d08.webm?t=1769168402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/624f87854c9411a58623e4dbdeea8d08.mp4?t=1769168402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your pond</strong><br>Sculpt and shape the land to form ponds, islands, and winding shorelines. Place rocks, lilies, and other natural props to set the scene. Then unlock decorations like lanterns and statues to make your pond truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/0ca38fed3438b9a7c405658b97dca2d4.poster.avif?t=1769168402\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/0ca38fed3438b9a7c405658b97dca2d4.webm?t=1769168402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/0ca38fed3438b9a7c405658b97dca2d4.mp4?t=1769168402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a home for frogs</strong><br><br>Design unique ponds to attract different frog species, each drawn to specific environments. Name your frogs, give them hats, and watch them hop around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/b469350245fa1a94e64a7b2f0a80f137.poster.avif?t=1769168402\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/b469350245fa1a94e64a7b2f0a80f137.webm?t=1769168402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/b469350245fa1a94e64a7b2f0a80f137.mp4?t=1769168402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax in nature </strong><br> Set the mood with a relaxing lofi soundtrack and layered ambient nature sounds. Toggle seasons, weather, and time of day to create the atmosphere you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist to support the game!</strong><br>Like what you see? Add Serene Ponds to your wishlist and join our cozy little frog-loving community as the game blossoms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924840?t=1769168402","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924840?t=1769168402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/0c8fb5ca7e7faec0eb1b739339535ead9c3a05c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769168402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/0c8fb5ca7e7faec0eb1b739339535ead9c3a05c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769168402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serene Ponds is a calm, creative sandbox about creating a peaceful pond for wildlife. Shape the land, add decorations and plants, and watch frogs gradually make themselves at home. There\u2019s no rush or failure, just the freedom to create and care for your pond at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/624f87854c9411a58623e4dbdeea8d08.poster.avif?t=1769168402\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/624f87854c9411a58623e4dbdeea8d08.webm?t=1769168402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/624f87854c9411a58623e4dbdeea8d08.mp4?t=1769168402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your pond</strong><br>Sculpt and shape the land to form ponds, islands, and winding shorelines. Place rocks, lilies, and other natural props to set the scene. Then unlock decorations like lanterns and statues to make your pond truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/0ca38fed3438b9a7c405658b97dca2d4.poster.avif?t=1769168402\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://sha